Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.54,0:02:12.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You listening, Pops?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.16,0:02:15.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Saruyama brothers?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.08,0:02:16.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.37,0:02:17.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.20,0:02:23.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.76,0:02:28.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was right here!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.90,0:02:41.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That bonehead! He did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.24,0:02:45.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unbelievably beautiful.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.20,0:02:48.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! That sound is amazing.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.37,0:02:49.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.71,0:02:56.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's come. As I always knew it would.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.53,0:02:58.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Destiny.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.80,0:03:02.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, this was the\Nringing that Noland heard.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.30,0:03:04.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.27,0:03:12.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Singing. Listen.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.52,0:03:15.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Vearth is singing a song.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.32,0:03:16.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.07,0:03:24.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is proof. God is real.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.87,0:03:27.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is surely a miracle!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.75,0:03:31.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I had almost abandoned hope that we\Nwould ever hear the golden bell again
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.84,0:03:35.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,after nearly 400 years of silence.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.13,0:03:38.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Great Warrior Kalgara.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.04,0:03:40.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can you hear it?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.87,0:03:45.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The unmistakable echo\Nof the Fire of Shandora!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.17,0:03:51.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good heavens.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.93,0:03:54.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What must've happened to this land?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.56,0:03:56.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is that strange chiming?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.18,0:04:00.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The legendary bell?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.79,0:04:00.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Could it be?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.66,0:04:08.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Montblanc Noland.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.45,0:04:11.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can you hear the bell sounding\Nfrom beyond your grave?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.22,0:04:16.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,May these chimes reverberate\Nall the way to your descendants.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.81,0:04:19.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now rest in peace, Noland.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.68,0:04:28.89,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You like the bells ringing too?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.89,0:04:30.52,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,– Yeah, I bet you do.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.25,0:04:48.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Old man! This is it!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.31,0:04:51.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! There's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.85,0:04:55.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Only one bell in this\Nworld could echo so far!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.84,0:04:58.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And with such emotion.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.43,0:05:03.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.13,0:05:04.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Absolutely!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.65,0:05:09.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Y'know those giants you see\Nin the Cumuloregalis Clouds?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.24,0:05:12.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The story goes a little\Nsomething like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.24,0:05:15.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whenever a human inhabits the sky\Nand the sun's rays shine upon him,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.87,0:05:20.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}his shadow is reflected on the deep mist,\Nand then cast far across the horizon.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.42,0:05:26.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}To onlookers, the shadow appears as if\Nit's a gigantic monster looming above.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.29,0:05:28.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ya mean those aren't really giants?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.04,0:05:29.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're actually somebody's shadow?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.75,0:05:32.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That would mean we've already\Nfound irrefutable proof
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.38,0:05:35.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that people do live in the sky!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.29,0:05:36.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.79,0:05:39.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I once thought the story\Nwas a meaningless fantasy
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.50,0:05:42.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and dismissed it altogether.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.09,0:05:45.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it seems there is\Ntruth to this legend.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.51,0:05:48.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My ears are filled\Nwith the resounding cries
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.36,0:05:50.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of the golden bell.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.50,0:05:57.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If a golden bell exists,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.17,0:05:59.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}then why not an entire city?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.24,0:06:01.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Noland was telling the truth!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.84,0:06:04.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His reputation can finally be redeemed!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.47,0:06:08.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And with it, our family name!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.27,0:06:11.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the reason you\Nrang the bell, isn't it, kid?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.14,0:06:12.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shrewd move!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.44,0:06:15.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have my thanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.23,0:06:16.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't forget this.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.63,0:06:37.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– What's wrong?\N– Hey, Cricket!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.14,0:06:39.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you sick? Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.49,0:06:42.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, it's those kids.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.30,0:06:44.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad they're safe!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.27,0:06:50.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was... Guess I was just so worried!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.39,0:07:10.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look! Up there!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.97,0:07:14.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's God's ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.74,0:07:26.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He sunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.43,0:07:31.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,God Eneru and his ship are...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.37,0:07:33.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...falling.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.96,0:07:43.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The bell's ringing\Nignites the Fire of Shandora,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.75,0:07:48.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that long-gone city that took pride,\Nabove all, in its prosperity.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.01,0:07:57.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The reverberations serve as the island's\Nsong, proclaiming the end of the battle.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.48,0:08:00.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A melody longing to\Nbe heard by the island
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.73,0:08:05.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and generations of its natives\Nand supporters for 400 years.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.83,0:08:17.04,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,Although the\Njourney of this restless island
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.76,0:08:22.89,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,seemed nearly endless, time cannot\Nfade even its most distant memory.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.60,0:08:27.72,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,For long ago, people entrusted their\Nwords in the sound of the golden bell.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.48,0:08:36.57,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,Lacing each ring with\Nwords of faith and hope,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.57,0:08:39.70,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,which resounded across the distant sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.13,0:08:43.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My friends!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.55,0:08:51.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It rang.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.08,0:08:57.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, I wonder if... if Pops heard it?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.76,0:08:59.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sure he did.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.82,0:09:11.49,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,We're right here!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.16,0:09:21.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bind the ropes\Nto the strongest-looking trees!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.62,0:09:56.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aisa. Were you scared, dear?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.58,0:09:59.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Surprise. Your treasure!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.01,0:10:01.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what? Who cares?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.30,0:10:07.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Laki!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.52,0:10:16.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The others?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.07,0:10:18.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're fine! Don't try to speak.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.86,0:10:21.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who's that over there?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.77,0:10:24.73,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Am I still alive?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.73,0:10:27.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! You have to be treated right away!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.81,0:10:29.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My wounds aren't that severe.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.77,0:10:32.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really. That guy.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.90,0:10:34.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He needs help more than me.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.83,0:10:36.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look after him.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.35,0:10:47.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.77,0:10:50.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His body's worn out. He's dying!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.41,0:10:52.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he was tryin' to kill us.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.01,0:10:54.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't owe him anything.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.75,0:10:55.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.63,0:11:00.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was going all out,\Njust like the rest of us.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.86,0:10:59.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It doesn't make much sense, but...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.94,0:11:04.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... He's a hero? Seriously?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.94,0:11:05.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.81,0:11:08.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.75,0:11:11.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Help him, Raccoon-Doggy?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.67,0:11:14.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a reindeer! Antlers! See?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.67,0:11:18.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. He'll survive.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.84,0:11:20.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks, reindeer!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.55,0:11:27.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pierre, you're\Ngoing to over-exert yourself.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.14,0:11:28.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go rest with the Blue Sea people.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.94,0:11:34.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.67,0:11:37.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I want you to go and\Ngather the families.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.30,0:11:42.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess anything's possible.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.70,0:11:46.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, what do you think\Nhappened to Eneru and the bell?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.58,0:11:48.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't know I guess\Nthey must've crashed.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.08,0:11:52.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So we have a city of gold.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.25,0:11:54.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But in name only.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.23,0:11:58.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Which just means that our\Nadventure in poverty continues.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.23,0:12:00.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd rather have dials\Nover gold any day.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.82,0:12:03.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's something we just\Ncan't get from the Blue Sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.98,0:12:07.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm to the point where I'd\Nsettle for some concrete news.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.28,0:12:08.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope Nami's all right.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.98,0:12:10.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And where's Conis?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.69,0:12:14.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This not knowing is driving me crazy!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.38,0:12:17.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you think it's a good idea to leave\NWyper with the Blue Sea dwellers?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.72,0:12:19.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.30,0:12:21.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It appears Aisa has befriended them.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.58,0:12:23.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to act quickly.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.29,0:12:25.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If our enemy wakes before\Nwe leave, we're finished.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.54,0:12:26.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gather those who can\Nmove and we'll banish
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.52,0:12:29.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,every last one of Eneru's\Npriests to the clouds.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.99,0:12:31.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.16,0:12:35.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So did you have a\Nchance to patch him up?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.07,0:12:37.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes. All he needs now is rest.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.64,0:12:39.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.74,0:12:49.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.51,0:12:51.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Conis!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.38,0:12:52.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.35,0:13:00.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're back! I'm so glad you're okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.64,0:13:05.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was afraid I wouldn't\Nsee any of you again!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.52,0:13:08.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She was worried! Ah!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.02,0:13:09.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.11,0:13:10.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you guys grabbed some food.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.86,0:13:12.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where's it from?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.44,0:13:16.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We found the priests' storage locker\Non our way back through the forest.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.15,0:13:17.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There were lots more!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.47,0:13:20.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But uh, how did you manage\Nto find your way back down?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.31,0:13:21.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My Gum-Gum Balloon.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.77,0:13:25.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Conis, where's your old man?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.02,0:13:22.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.65,0:13:28.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He, um... Well, he...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.08,0:13:30.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He protected me.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.12,0:13:31.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And then Eneru...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.42,0:13:38.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.73,0:13:44.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.32,0:13:46.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.45,0:13:47.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Me three.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.33,0:13:52.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.36,0:13:53.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.98,0:13:56.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.73,0:14:01.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You were on the lower\Nlevel of the White Sea?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.27,0:14:04.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I found myself there after\Nbeing blasted from the ledge.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.73,0:14:06.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I wasn't alone.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.41,0:14:11.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Countless others ended up in the same spot\Nwhile making their way toward Cloud End.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.38,0:14:17.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Yet, as we speak, they too are now on the\Njourney back via the restored Milky Roads.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.08,0:14:19.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course, given that there's\Nno longer an Angel Island,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.91,0:14:22.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a new destination was chosen.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.12,0:14:23.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.39,0:14:36.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.77,0:14:38.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We owe you our lives, god.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.43,0:14:39.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just Gan Fall.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.80,0:14:42.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I no longer go by that title.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.68,0:14:45.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You were all forced to work\Nin a place like this
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.06,0:14:47.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for six long years.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.06,0:14:48.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.47,0:14:50.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We lost Angel Island,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.60,0:14:52.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the home we were supposed to return to.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.85,0:14:57.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And like the Shandorians,\Nour birthright's now lost.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.32,0:15:00.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is the battle really over?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.55,0:15:08.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,God's army has gone,\Nbut I just don't...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.05,0:15:10.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My Chief.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.22,0:15:13.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you really believe the 400-year\Nrift can be mended so easily?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.79,0:15:17.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.25,0:15:19.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Boy. I stuffed myself!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.41,0:15:20.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, it's getting\Npretty late you guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.92,0:15:22.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's time to hit the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.63,0:15:24.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're not talkin'\Nabout leaving, are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.96,0:15:26.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.23,0:15:28.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp, can you believe\Nwhat she just said?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.44,0:15:30.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hardly. It's sick.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.15,0:15:33.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I mean, the thought doesn't even cross\Nher mind to go out and look for gold.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.49,0:15:35.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And she calls herself a pirate!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.02,0:15:38.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How'd you two like fat lips\Nto go with your fat bellies?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.95,0:15:46.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.24,0:15:49.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And soon... I will return!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.50,0:15:53.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To the wide-open sky:\Nthe perfect home for a god!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.08,0:15:54.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pristine and unobstructed.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.42,0:16:00.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, and best of all,\Nno pests to get in my way!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.88,0:16:05.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll be sure no one gets near it.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.18,0:16:08.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My own private paradise.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.39,0:16:11.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A land boundless, exquisite.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.32,0:16:15.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's just like a dream...\Nwhich comes to life!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.46,0:16:19.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maxim.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.86,0:16:22.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Set sail and deliver me to\Nmy new floating kingdom,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.97,0:16:25.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,which shines brightly in the night.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.55,0:16:27.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The land without end.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.37,0:16:29.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Endless Vearth!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.31,0:16:36.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.73,0:16:39.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Inside the ruins of Shandora.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.60,0:16:42.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gan Fall!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.23,0:16:44.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't move yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.36,0:16:46.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You! You're a Skypiean!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.34,0:16:50.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rest.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.71,0:16:52.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chief!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.09,0:16:54.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We are all bound together.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.01,0:16:56.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Made brothers by the war.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.60,0:16:58.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The golden belfry.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.14,0:17:00.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the Shandorians' sacred\Nduty to protect it to the end!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.95,0:17:04.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.17,0:17:07.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the sound of war\Ndrums announcing battle!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.36,0:17:10.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's the signal fire, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.57,0:17:12.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Patience, Wyper.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.07,0:17:13.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rest a while longer.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.63,0:17:16.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The heroism of our ancestors is clear.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.40,0:17:22.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But whatever violence happened in the past,\Nyou must allow it to stay there.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.23,0:17:24.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our future starts here.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.15,0:17:27.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is our home now, and we\NShandorians will make it a good one.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.79,0:17:29.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.17,0:17:32.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Most often, the call for\Nvengeance cannot be ignored.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.71,0:17:38.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But today, it has been drowned out by\Na sea of voices screaming in celebration.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.77,0:17:52.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.41,0:17:54.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.45,0:18:07.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
